<title>MONGOLIA: Mongolia inflation up 5.8 pct in April from March.</title>
<headline>Mongolia inflation up 5.8 pct in April from March.</headline>
<dateline>ULAN BATOR 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mongolia's consumer price inflation rose 5.8 percent in April compared with March, the Bank of Mongolia's statistical bulletin said on Friday.</p>
<p>In March, inflation rose by 2.3 percent compared with the previous month. Month to month inflation in March 1996 was 0.3 percent and 2.3 percent in April.</p>
<p>Consumer price inflation from January to April had risen 14.4 percent, the bulletin said.</p>
<p>It gave no more details.</p>
</text>
